# CO-ADMIN-005 — Enterprise Product & Lender Master

Status: **ENTERPRISE APPROVED**

## Principles

- Products and Lenders are **Master Data** (Enterprise Registry).
- No hard-coded product lists for operational dropdowns.
- Opportunity / Deal / Customer product selections consume Product Master (registry-first, canonical fallback).
- Lender selections consume Lender Registry.
- Product–Lender offers configured via matrix (`productsSupported` + programs) — never hard-coded lender lists.

